---

<div class="space-y-6">
  <!-- Comparison Matrix -->
  <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-850 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-xs space-y-5">
    <div class="border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 pb-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-['Outfit',sans-serif]">
          Why Free Expense Tracker Outperforms Other Tools
        </h3>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/60">
          vs. Traditional Tools & Platforms
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-1">
        We analyzed conventional budgeting platforms and online financial worksheets to build a modern, truly private, zero-friction financial planner.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Table -->
    <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[620px] text-left border-collapse text-xs">
        <thead class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
          <tr>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">Evaluation Criteria</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4 text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/70 dark:bg-emerald-950/70">Free Expense Tracker (freexpensetracker.com)</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Traditional Budgeting Sites</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Privacy & Data Storage</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/30 dark:bg-emerald-950/40">
              100% Client-Side (<code class="text-[11px] font-mono dark:bg-emerald-900/60 dark:text-emerald-100 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">localStorage</code>). No signup, no email capture, zero tracking.
            </td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Funnels users toward debt consolidation phone calls and lead-generation intake forms.
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Bank & File Import</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/30 dark:bg-emerald-950/40">
              Drop Excel (<code class="text-[11px] font-mono dark:bg-emerald-900/60 dark:text-emerald-100 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">.xlsx</code>) or CSV files with auto-categorization & live insights.
            </td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              No file import capability. Requires tedious manual typing of every single bill.
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Budget Frameworks</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/30 dark:bg-emerald-950/40">
              4 Dynamic Models: 50/30/20, 70/20/10, 80/20, and Zero-Based Budgeting.
            </td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Rigid, predefined static expense categories with no model flexibility.
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Interactive Simulation</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/30 dark:bg-emerald-950/40">
              Real-time income range sliders, instant SVG charts, and interactive dial updates.
            </td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Static text forms with slow page reloads and no visual simulation.
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Multi-Modal Export</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/30 dark:bg-emerald-950/40">
              Live web app + Formula-ready Excel download + High-contrast printable booklet.
            </td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Basic generic PDF downloads with no formula capabilities.
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Financial Health Score</td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/30 dark:bg-emerald-950/40">
              Algorithmic 0–100 score dial evaluating savings rate, fixed burdens, and cashflow buffers.
            </td>
            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Subjective questionnaires designed to steer users to credit counselors.
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
